{"id":"f1ec05e4371875ae","group":"90","path":"90/90-cor-liar-independent.md","title":"No Full Liar Configuration in a Consistent Theory","display":"cor-liar-independent — No Full Liar Configuration in a Consistent Theory","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-cor-liar-independent","aliases":["90-cor-liar-independent"],"display":"cor-liar-independent — No Full Liar Configuration in a Consistent Theory","depends_on":["[[90-df-liar-paradox]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-cor-liar-independent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-cor-liar-independent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-liar-independent — No Full Liar Configuration in a Consistent Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e57623a088eec9a8\" href=\"?note=e57623a088eec9a8\" title=\"90-df-liar-paradox\">90-df-liar-paradox</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，可证关系使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>；只使用已给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Liar}\">\\(\\mathrm{Liar}\\)</span> 配置，不另假设对角引理来替代其两个合取条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory supporting diagonalization)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (fixed syntax encoding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\tau(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (candidate internal truth formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau)\\)</span> (liar-configuration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e57623a088eec9a8\" href=\"?note=e57623a088eec9a8\" title=\"90-df-liar-paradox\">90-df-liar-paradox</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency predicate)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}liar\\text{-}independent}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}liar\\text{-}independent}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>完整说谎者配置给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L\">\\(T\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L\\)</span>。经典命题逻辑从该式推出每个句子，特别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=(0=S0)\">\\(\\bot=(0=S0)\\)</span>；这与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> 矛盾。此方向不需要额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg\\bot\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>上游“说谎者配置”同时包含自否定固定点和适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的 T-模式；两者推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L\">\\(T\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>因此正确结论不是“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 独立”，而是一致理论中不存在这种完整配置；把说谎者句与 Gödel 句混同会得到错误命题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-liar-paradox","status":"resolved","id":"e57623a088eec9a8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-liar-paradox]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，可证关系使用 [[90-df-predicate-logic]]；只使用已给 $\\mathrm{Liar}$ 配置，不另假设对角引理来替代其两个合取条件。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-liar-paradox","status":"resolved","id":"e57623a088eec9a8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau)$ (liar-configuration predicate, see [[90-df-liar-paradox]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Liar}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}liar\\text{-}independent}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Liar}_{T,g}(L;\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot=(0=S0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\neg\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash L\\leftrightarrow\\neg L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1780,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-cor-creative-not-recursive.md]]\n[[90-cor-godel-sound.md]]\n[[90-cor-henkin-provable.md]]\n[[90-cor-henkin-sentence.md]]\n[[90-cor-hypersimple-not-creative.md]]\n[[90-cor-liar-independent.md]]"}],"outgoing":["e57623a088eec9a8","4e89323a1592aeb9","b7d96c072a4c677f"]}